  "discription": {
    "note": "Classic stinzen plant with nodding buds that open into fragrant, star-shaped yellow flowers in April. Spreads by stolons in grassland, orchards and light woodland on old estates; often more leaves than flowers in shade. Bulbs can cause contact dermatitis.",
    "noteNL": "Klassieke stinzenplant met knikkende knoppen die openen tot geurende, stervormige gele bloemen in april. Breidt uit via uitlopers in grasland, boomgaarden en lichte bossen op oude buitenplaatsen; in schaduw vaak meer blad dan bloemen. Bollen kunnen contactdermatitis geven."
